### 检索词与数据源

**主要检索词**：
- "short-term synaptic plasticity review" PubMed → 发现 Zucker & Regehr 2002
- "synaptotagmin-7 facilitation" PubMed/PMC → Jackman 2016 (PMC4729191), Turecek 2017 (PMC5892411), Norman 2023 (PMC10611806)
- "activity-silent working memory STP" PMC → Mongillo 2008, Grover 2026 (PMC12908934)
- "PFC short-term facilitation synaptic overfilling" PMC → Shin 2026 (PMC12890252)
- "temporal filtering STP low-pass high-pass" PMC → Motanis 2018 (PMC6171349)
- "vesicle depletion short-term depression" PubMed → Dobrunz & Stevens 1997 (PMID:22751149 - abstract)

